type: software
title: "VariationalAnalysis: variational analysis and generalized differentiation in Lean 4"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 / Mathlib library of variational analysis and generalized differentiation: normal
  cones, subdifferentials, coderivatives, variational and extremal principles, well-posedness,
  optimality conditions, SCD mappings and second-order theory.
